      "quote": "## §0 関数境界\n\npure functionはnetwork、credential store、DB、filesystem、clockを直接読まず、明示入力を判定する。connector/Python adapterは\nobservation/proposalを返すだけで、projection commitはNode portに限定する。外部認証・接続、credential解決、write-back APIは\n本sliceに実装しない。\n",
      "file_sha256": "48014b188ebe0c3ffe18b86fa472f048a88e248316bf2b3218aaa605a5e55f42",
      "selected_lines_sha256": "98542d7dc84d328984c1b8318bbbf87b12067f35e639e233b7c31322c77ab987",
      "asset": {
        "asset_id": "LEGACY-ASSET-DD66C1B6B7BE234B37E6",
        "disposition": "unresolved",
        "source_sha256": "48014b188ebe0c3ffe18b86fa472f048a88e248316bf2b3218aaa605a5e55f42"
      },
      "reuse": "reference_only",
      "preserve": "明示入力pure/adapter observationとproposal非commit、envelope/schema/provenance/fenceの再検証とunknown/partial result非昇格。",
      "change": "旧Node/Python broker/DB/projectionを移植せず、CONNECT003の同operation送受信/契約外拒否/技術・業務責務分離へ再導出。",
      "reason": "採択003と10/12承認が接続契約envelopeとendpoint業務owner保持を要求する。"
    },
    {
      "path": "archive/legacy-generation-2026-09-14/root/docs/design/helix/L5-detail/product-data-connector.md",
      "read_lines": [
        47,
        57
      ],
      "quote": "| `ProductDataReadConnectorPort` | versioned requestを外部read adapterへ渡しrecord pageとcursorを返す | bounded ephemeral observation | arbitrary query、write-back、credential本文の返却、raw inputのpersistent seal |\n| `ProductDataProjectionWorker` | raw pageからcanonical entity/mapping proposalを導出 | Python proposal artifactだけ | harness.db、current pointer、watermarkへのwrite |\n| `ProductDataProposalIngestionPort` | worker envelope、source/schema/mapping/lineage/digestをNodeで再検証 | staged proposal | partial result、late fence、schema不明resultの昇格 |\n| `ProductDataPolicyGate` | classification、redaction、retention、freshness、agent-context field allowlistを評価 | policy receipt | PII/secret/raw payload複製、unknown classificationの通過 |\n| `ProductDataProjectionCommitter` | entity/mapping、旧current、snapshot、watermarkを一transactionでcommit | Node `HarnessDbPort`だけ | Python/connectorからのDB write、watermark先行更新 |\n| `ProductDataQuarantineStore` | drift/policy/authority findingとrelease条件をappend-only管理 | quarantine event | raw payload保存、無期限・ownerなしrelease |\n\nPythonは共通`PythonWorkerBroker`を通じてproposalだけを返す。run output root以外のwrite、DB pathの受領、repository/current\npointerへのアクセスを許可しない。Nodeは`complete`後にresult set、schema、provenance、lease/fence、artifact digestを再検証し、\n検証済みproposalだけをprojection transactionへ渡す。`HIL_PRODUCT_DIRECT_WRITE_FORBIDDEN`は\n`HIL_PYTHON_AUTHORITY_BYPASS`をproduct-data境界で失わず集約する。",
      "file_sha256": "2b42c26f7e4d387a6e2b178de05c2c27ac946646f266faee95aa08a65e803b04",
      "selected_lines_sha256": "0da9dc830d9342630a3a9b55aa7965b69239abdb557b659949d9c02afcf0debd",
      "asset": {
